    "quote": "With probability at least $1-\\delta$, the regret of Algorithm~\\ref{alg:regret_robust} satisfies $\\sum_{t=1}^T \\mu_x - \\mu_{x_t} \\lesssim \\ c_1 \\log(|\\mc{X}|/\\delta)+ \\sqrt{\\max_{\\mc{V}\\subset \\mc{X}}f(\\mc{V},\\gamma)}\\times \\Big(T(h\\!+\\!\\sqrt{\\gamma} \\|\\theta_*\\|)\\! + \\!\\sqrt{c_0^2(\\sigma^2\\!+\\!B^2)T\\log(|\\mc{X}|\\log(T)/\\delta)} \\Big)$"
   },
   "confidence": "medium",
   "notes": "Bound stated with \\lesssim (up to absolute constants). The paper then states that gamma=1/T, delta=1/T give expected regret c' sqrt(max_V f(V,1/T)) (hT + sqrt(log(|X|T) T)), and Lemma 2 shows max_V f(V,1/T) <= 1.5 gamma_T, so the bound is at most of order ||theta*|| sqrt(gamma_T T) up to log factors. That corollary is running text, not a formal statement, and is not recorded separately."
